\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 ===========================
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Added a function for removing gaps that are e.g. created by TAO recording
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 freedb ID can be used for filename creation
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Extentend M3U files with additional song information are always created
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 AccurateRip support
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 EAC is able to test the return value of an external encoder (if supported by the external application)
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Added some more LAME DLL presets
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Fixed several bugs and some minor additions
\par 
\par 
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 What\hich\f43 \rquote \loch\f43 s new in version 0.95 prebeta 4
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 ===========================
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Fixed sample rate conversion on compression (EAC is now doing the rate conversion itself), and included a new native SCSI interface.
\par 
\par 
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 What\hich\f43 \rquote \loch\f43 s new in version 0.95 prebeta 3
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 ===========================
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Some more bugs of 0.95 prebeta 2 and some translation issues \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 fixed
\par 
\par 
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 What\hich\f43 \rquote \loch\f43 s new in version 0.95 prebeta 2
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 ===========================
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Severe bugs of 0.95 prebeta 1 fixed
\par 
\par 
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 What\hich\f43 \rquote \loch\f43 s new in version 0.95 prebeta 1
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 ===========================
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 The main feature  is the language SDK, which enables people to translate EAC into nearly any language. There is more information on that at the download location. 
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Besides that, there are only minor additions and a lot of bugfixes. 
\par 
\par 
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 What's new in version 0.9 beta 4
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 ===========================
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 This version only contains some bugfixes, mainly the CD burning part is fixed, but also many small corrections are taken from the 0.95pb1 that make already progress
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Also the lock ups in the wave editor may occur \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 again or may be gone now, please tell about your experiences if you encountered problems before
\par 
\par 
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 What's new in version 0.9 beta 3
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 ===========================
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Most FFT procedures are now in assembler, increasing speed for many audio filters and also for spectral display, which additionally has increased bands
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Several smaller additions and improvements
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Hopefully bugfixed all other minor problems
\par 
\par 
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 What's new in version 0.9 beta 2
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 ===========================
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 This version is only a bug fix for the previous release.
\par 
\par 
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 What's new in version 0.9 beta 1
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 ===========================
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 GUI restructured, added new buttons, changed button type to flat buttons. Artist and CD information is now directly accessible through the main window
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Profile usage is now easier and can be selected by a drop down box on the main window
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Updated freedb usage to proto 5
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Configuration Wizard to setup basic drive, encoder and freedb configuration for beginner users
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Option setting for lea\hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 ving out all advanced features, making it easier for beginners
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 
Secondary C2 extraction mode (may work better for some kind of erraneous CDs and for some but not every drive. Even if it may be misused for copy protected CDs, using this mode on protected CDs is only allowed when legal in your country)
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Manual detection of TOC, usefull if a CD is defective and displays wrong track positions or data tracks instead of audio, EAC will try to detect the CD structure by analysis
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Uncompressed and compressed extrac\hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 tion is now divided, so compression options will missing "Internal WAV routines"
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 More placeholders for external command line encoders in "User Defined Encoder" format, see FAQ for details
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Correction of MP+ decoding bug with command line decoder
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 New Monkeys Audio (MAC) DLL support, you need at least DLL version 3.94
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Compression queue is saved to harddisk and continued on next EAC session
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Improving Pop Detection to 4 band analysis
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Display of actual extraction position in real music time (for error checking)
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Small corrections to ID3V2 routines
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Correction of support for some writers
\par 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Many smaller additions and bug fixes
\par 
